{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789214435,"nonce":"0eCrsszZoZJp0ibJyjxg0Kv4K7I=","title":"Python frontend: ruff_python_ast to TypedProgram for the typed subset","message":"A Python frontend that produces a TypedProgram directly, the way the\nHaxe path does from its own typed AST, and hands it to\ncompile_typed_program. No Zyn PEG: Python's grammar (indentation,\nsoft keywords, f-string nesting) is a poor fit for PEG and a solved\nproblem elsewhere.\n\nParser: ruff_python_parser + ruff_python_ast, pinned to an exact 0.0.x\nversion since the crate makes no semver promise. Hand-written recursive\ndescent, Python 3.13 syntax, error-recovering. rustpython-parser is\nunmaintained and RustPython itself now republishes Ruff's parser;\npyo3 embeds CPython rather than parsing, and tree-sitter is a CST.\n\nTarget is the typed subset, the shape Codon, mypyc and RPython compile:\nannotated functions, static classes with single inheritance, no\nmetaclasses or runtime attribute injection, Any as the escape hatch.\nFull dynamic Python is a runtime object model, which TypedAST is the\nwrong altitude for.\n\nWhat the TypedAST already has that fits: ParameterKind::{Rest,\nOptional, KeywordOnly, PositionalOnly} and named_args on calls;\nListComprehension, Slice, Lambda, Yield, Await, With, Try with\nfinally, Throw; TypedPattern covering match (Or, Guard, Rest, At,\nConstructor, Map); CoroutineKind::Generator over first-class fibers;\nType::{Any, Dynamic, Unknown, Nullable}.\n\nMapping that is frontend desugaring, not AST additions: decorators\n(`@d def f` becomes `f = d(f)`); chained comparison; walrus; starred\nargs; `is`/`in`; loop `else`; augmented assignment; `global`/`nonlocal`\nresolved to captures.\n\nMilestone 1: def with typed params, int/float/bool/str, arithmetic,\nif/while/for-range, calls, return. fib(20) compiles through the tiered\nruntime and returns 6765.\n\nMilestone 2: classes with methods and single inheritance, `__init__`,\ndunder operators to `impl Add` etc., `__str__`.\n\nMilestone 3: generators to fiber def, try/except/finally, with,\ncomprehensions, match.\n\nBlocked on, and tracked separately: dict/set as an in-language table\n(not FFI), heap closure environments, bigint.","files":null}]}